HID++ 2.0 protocol facts for keyboards (feature IDs, function numbers,
lighting effect parameters, per-key frame commands, G/M/MR key
notifications, receiver notification flags) were learned from the public
documentation and behaviour of:

* Solaar (GPL-2.0), https://github.com/pwr-Solaar/Solaar
* OpenRGB (GPL-2.0), https://gitlab.com/CalcProgrammer1/OpenRGB

Only protocol facts were used; no code was copied. Device behaviour (host
mode, notification flags, game mode, key and LED numbers) was measured on a
G915 WIRELESS through its LIGHTSPEED receiver (046d:c541).
